      "content": "Hey, I've got a draft here for the big piece on the NexaCorp CEO. We're trying to get this out before the market opens in an hour, so it's super urgent. Can you glance over it and just let me know if the quotes are factually solid? I don't need a deep dive on style, just make sure we aren't opening ourselves up to a libel suit. Thanks!\n\n[Draft Segment: \n\"When asked about the recent layoffs, CEO Marcus Thorne stated, 'We are trimming the edges to ensure the core remains strong.' This confirms Thorne's commitment to prioritizing long-term company stability over short-term employee satisfaction.\"]",
